+
+Results: `21-fresh-k-kompile.log`, `22-fresh-expanded-ast-identity.log`,
+`23-fresh-kprove-loop.log`, `24-fresh-kprove-full.log`.
+
+The independently created source-body mutant was compiled and rejected with:
