+# Independent Stage 3–5 audit: `143-words-in-sentence`
+
+## Scope and result
+
+The launcher binding validates as problem `143-words-in-sentence`, condition
+`kit-semantics`, semantics mode `SUPPLIED_SEMANTICS`, and audit mode
